    "min_fetch_counts_comment": "Per-source raw-fetch floors (a source fetching below its floor aborts the run BEFORE any load/prune — a truncated/partial fetch can't self-wipe). Only OSM (geometry) is floor-gated here; NPS/USGS are enrichment (USGS is 3DEP elevation and never fetches). This floor is a CONSERVATIVE pre-calibration estimate — this config-only lane cannot run a live Overpass fetch, so unlike the pilot regions there is no measured baseline yet. Recalibrate to ~70% of the measured live baseline after the first successful ingest. Env-overridable via ADVENTURE_FETCH_MIN_OSM.",
